    "promptText": "Title: Project: CHHS Rebrand (The Pitch and Focus Group Prep)\n\nDescription:\n\nYou have analyzed the brand. Now, you have to sell the new vision. We are going to use this slide deck to conduct Focus Groups with students and staff. Your goal is to turn your written thoughts into visuals that will spark a conversation.\n\nThe Assignment:\n\nCreate a 5 to 7 slide presentation that summarizes your Brand Audit.\n\nSlide Requirements:\n\n- Title and Hook: Your new \"Tagline\" or \"Theme\" for the school.\n- The Target Persona: Visualize the student body with images.\n- The Gap Analysis: Visually contrast the \"Current Reality\" vs. the \"Desired Future.\"\n- The Vision: Show how your vision aligns with modern trends.\n- Focus Group Questions: List 3 specific questions you would ask a student focus group to see if your brand ideas resonate.\n\nSubmission:\n\nSubmit your presentation file."
