    "definitionOfDone": "ASSIGNMENT: L20 MY CAUSE MY CLEATS (PARTNERSHIP ANALYSIS)\nCOURSE: 8175 Sports Entertainment and Event Marketing\nCOMPETENCIES ASSESSED: 8175-2, 8175-8, 8175-11\n\nCRITERIA\n- 8175-2 Demonstrate critical thinking and problem-solving.\n    * Evidence of recognizing and analyzing problems\n    * Evidence of evaluating potential solutions and resources\n    * Evidence of using a logical approach to make decisions and solve problems\n    * Evidence of implementing effective courses of action\n- 8175-8 Demonstrate respect for diversity.\n    * Evidence of defining diversity and discussing its importance\n    * Evidence of identifying individual differences (e.g., age, gender, ethnicity, culture, race, viewpoints, socioeconomic status, and ability)\n    * Evidence of showing respect for and valuing individual differences in the workplace\n    * Evidence of being self-aware and mindful of one’s own bias\n    * Evidence of collaborating with people of diverse backgrounds, viewpoints, and experiences\n- 8175-11 Demonstrate big-picture thinking.\n    * Evidence of defining big-picture thinking as an understanding of one's role in fulfilling the mission of the workplace and a consideration of the social, economic, and environmental effects of one's actions\n    * Evidence of identifying the organization’s structure, culture, policies, and procedures, as well as its role and position within the community, industry, and economy\n\nTEACHER GRADING NOTES\nScan student responses for the \"Why.\" If the student identifies the athlete, the charity, and provides a genuine reason for the partnership, award full points.\n\nPASSING STANDARD\nThe work passes when it completes every part of the assignment above, in the student's own words, and shows evidence for each competency listed. Specific examples, not general statements. Work that skips a part, or restates the prompt without doing it, does not pass.",
    "promptText": "Title: Assignment: My Cause My Cleats (The Power of Strategic Partnership)\n\nDescription:\n\nWhen an athlete partners with a non profit, it is a powerful form of Co Branding. It builds their public image while driving massive awareness for a cause. We are looking at the NFL \"My Cause My Cleats\" campaign.\n\nThe Task:\n\nSelect one NFL athlete and the Non Profit organization they represented. Answer the following in a minimum of 100 words:\n\n- Who is the athlete and what is the organization?\n- The Why: Explain the connection. Did the athlete choose this cause because of a personal experience?\n- The Impact: From a marketing perspective, how does this partnership help the athlete's personal brand and the non profit organization?\n\nSubmission:\n\nSubmit your analysis as a Text Entry."
