    "promptText": "Title: Assignment: Preparing Your Elevator Pitch (The 30 Second Commercial)\n\nDescription:\n\nYou only get one chance to make a great first impression! An \"Elevator Pitch\" is a quick summary of your background and experience.\n\nThe Task:\n\nFill in at least two to three specific examples for each category below.\n\n- Education: Courses that inspired you.\n- Top Strengths: Specific skills.\n- Achievements: Awards, certifications, personal bests.\n- Academic Projects: Research projects or events you planned.\n- Target Organizations: What type of companies interest you?\n- Inspiration: Who do you look up to?\n- Interesting Facts: What sets you apart from the typical student?\n\nSubmission:\n\nSubmit your completed document as a File Upload."
